# Claude Code's working directory: agent skills, hooks and per-machine
# settings. Local tooling rather than part of the product — installed per
# machine (e.g. `npx impeccable install`), and not something a clone of Quoin
# needs in order to build, test or run it.
.claude/
.impeccable/
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md

# Real environment files — keep .env.example tracked, ignore actual .env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The local server's data directory (`npm run dev:server`): accounts, synced
# courses and uploaded media. Never something to commit.
.data/
